   "gap": {
    "class": "linker",
    "summary": "riwl: `function signature mismatch for __fixunsdfti: wanted (F64) -> (I64, I64) defined (I32, F64) -> ()`; the bin does not link at opt-levels 0 and 2 (i128 -> float, i128 div/rem libcalls work)",
    "root_cause": "clif2wasm lowers libcalls that return i128 with a multi-value return; the LLVM-built compiler_builtins uses an sret pointer (wasm32 C ABI). Where clif2wasm maps the i128 return of an imported libcall signature was not located (inference: the signature mapping of I128 returns to an (I64, I64) pair)"
   }
  },
